{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"拉回 (范畴论)"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"拉回"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在一个范畴中, <strong>拉回</strong> (pullback) 一般是指以如下范畴为指标范畴的"},{"Local":{"url":"极限","text":"极限"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n{ccc}\r\n&amp;&amp;\\bullet\\\\\r\n&amp;&amp;\\downarrow\\\\\r\n\\bullet &amp; \\to &amp;\\bullet\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n“多个对象指向一个对象” 的指标范畴的极限也可称为拉回. 对偶的操作称为"},{"Local":{"url":"推出","text":"推出"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>另见"},{"Local":{"url":"推前","text":"拉回 (纤维范畴)"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>在具有"},{"Local":{"url":"有限极限","text":"有限极限"}},{"Plain":"的范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中, 沿态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 拉回给出"},{"Local":{"url":"俯范畴","text":"俯范畴"}},{"Plain":"之间的函子\n$$\r\nf^*\\colon \\mathcal C_{/Y} \\to \\mathcal C_{/X};\r\n$$\n这个函子总有"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"左伴随"}},{"Plain":" $f_!\\colon \\mathcal C_{/X} \\to \\mathcal C_{/Y}$, $(W\\to X) \\mapsto (W\\to X\\overset{f}{\\to} Y)$.</p>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"LCCC","text":"局部积闭范畴"}},{"Plain":"中, 拉回还有右伴随 $f_*\\colon \\mathcal C_{/X} \\to \\mathcal C_{/Y}$, 见"},{"Local":{"url":"依值积","text":"依值积"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n"}]}}